                <pb facs="0941" n="835" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg835"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Merry to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-07-10"><hi rendition="#italic">July 10,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Merry reports that all efforts for peace are useless. Salvadorian general
                    commanding forced fight on Guatemala territory; civil authorities favored peace.
                    He suggests war vessel on the coast, Declaration of war is not yet made.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
